          "role": "assistant",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "1. **[P1 material] src/components/hero/Viewport3D.tsx:219** — Calling `grid.dispose()` throws a fatal runtime `TypeError: grid.dispose is not a function` on unmount.\n   *Fix:* Replace with `grid.geometry.dispose(); (grid.material as THREE.Material).dispose();`.\n\n2. **[P1 material] src/components/sections/ServicesSection.tsx:125** — Mutating and resetting global `moduleCounter` inside render causes severe hydration mismatches and ID drift in StrictMode.\n   *Fix:* Declare module IDs statically in the configuration arrays.\n\n3. **[P1 material] src/components/hero/TerminalBoot.tsx:18** — Sync hydration mismatch when `useReducedMotion()` returns true, causing client initial state to immediately diverge from SSR.\n   *Fix:* Initialize states to server-safe defaults (`0` / `false`) and update in `useEffect`.\n\n4. **[P1 material] src/components/sections/LaunchTimelineSection.tsx:75** — Hydration mismatch from conditionally rendering different element types (`<motion.div>` vs `<div>`) based on `prefersReduced`.\n   *Fix:* Render `<motion.div>` unconditionally and let Framer Motion handle motion preferences.\n\n5. **[P2 polish] src/components/hero/Viewport3D.tsx:173** — Performance inefficiency: `requestAnimationFrame` loop continually schedules itself even when scrolled offscreen, causing idle CPU wakeups.\n   *Fix:* Cancel and resume scheduling the loop directly inside the `IntersectionObserver` callback.\n\n6. **[P2 polish] src/components/sections/ConnectSection.tsx:9, TestimonialsSection.tsx:6** — Unused imports `CalendarDays` and `Star` from `lucide-react` break lint hygiene.\n   *Fix:* Delete the unused imports.\n\n7. **[P2 polish] src/components/hero/TerminalBoot.tsx:55, CaseStudiesSection.tsx:103** — Clickable/scrollable `tabIndex={0}` container elements lack visible focus indicators on dark surfaces.\n   *Fix:* Add `focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-hp-bright`.",
          "timestamp": 1785575063001
        }
